OL,3,AIMF tells advanced economies to 'bring
OL,4,Adebt down' as borrowing costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's advanced economies
OL,7,Fincluding the UK and US need to cut
OL,8,Fborrowing and reduce debt levels
OL,9,Ffollowing weeks of spiralling
OL,10,Fgovernment interest costs, the head of
OL,11,Fthe International Monetary Fund (IMF)
OL,12,Fhas warned.
OL,14,FIn an exclusive interview, Kristalina
OL,15,FGeorgieva said global economic shocks
OL,16,Fhad been "pushing debt levels up like a
OL,17,Fstaircase not to heaven" but that
OL,18,Fgovernments had taken "no action to
OL,19,Fcontain that service cost".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
