OL,3,AIMF tells advanced economies to 'bring
OL,4,Adebt down' as borrowing costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,F"[It's] time to take that action," she
OL,7,Fsaid, adding that "courage" was needed
OL,8,Fby politicians to take the necessary
OL,9,Fsteps.
OL,11,FThe intervention comes as government
OL,12,Fborrowing costs have surged in response
OL,13,Fto wars disrupting the supply of oil,
OL,14,Fwhich has fuelled inflation.
